'''Condemned Peng''' (ギルティ・ペン, ''Giruti Pen'', '''Guilty Pen''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Jackie Peng]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

