==Enemy==
A nasty peon with 280 range and stats between [[Aku Doge]] and [[Aku Gory]] alongside a 50% chance to slow units on hit. His range, although inferior to go-to units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], nevertheless enables him to easily demolish [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. What makes him even worse is the level 3 [[Surge Attack|Surge]] created when he is slain, as even one Condemned Peng can already be annoying with his high damage and groups will cause some serious chaos.

==Strategy==
While fighting this enemy, make sure to spawn [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] consistently, as Condemned Pengs are typically used as support for stronger enemies like [[Le'Behemoth]] or [[Fallen Bear]] and can destroy your line of defense when paired with the [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]] making your meatshields have low health. The Surges they leave behind are usually deadlier than the Condemned Pengs themselves, so using [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune units]] like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] and [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] is recommended against groups of them.

