==Trivia==
*His design may be a reference to [[wikia:Disney:Maleficent|Maleficent]], the main antagonist of Disney's ''[[wikia:Disney:Sleeping Beauty|Sleeping Beauty]]''.
*The [[Media:Ghost chapel splash jp 2.png|second Japanese event poster]] for [[01 The Ghost Chapel|#01 The Ghost Chapel]] reveals that "The Sleepless Peng" was directed by none other than [[Director Kurosawah]]. The same poster also says Kurosawah directed a movie adaptation of the novel "Eguchi Kōkō" (江口高校, "Eguchi High School"), which involves a girl's puberty and was mentioned in [[Professor A.]]'s Japanese description.
*He is the only [[Jackie Peng]] variant to not do any form of acrobatics in his attack.
*He, [[Sinner Snache]], [[Le'Behemoth]], [[Fallen Bear]] and [[Wicked Face]] were added to the game files in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]], but were unimplemented and used [[Doge]]'s stats and sprites as placeholders until [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].
*He is the only [[:Category:Death Surge Enemies|Death Surge enemy]] with a [[Surge Attack|Surge]] level higher than Lv.1.

